---
description: Development commands for this project (install, run, test, lint)
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commands

```bash
# Install with dev dependencies
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Run the server (requires .env with GITHUB_PAT)
python server.py

# Run all tests
pytest tests/

# Run a single test file
pytest tests/test_file_ops.py

# Run a single test
pytest tests/test_file_ops.py::test_read_file_success

# Lint and format
ruff check .
ruff format .
```
